trios&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRsFFTYntpXa5LSXd68nyEVp53tkIIt2B7_m9t0LkpdA&oe=6B087226"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "video-thumb.png", "id": "896068849090374", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_896068852423707_6468028910789789512_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uatQlPJMzxgQ7kNvwHO1x2c&_nc_oc=AdotmysRm5Z7o6-u6F79sHVxUKFywdjB0FwLhY0-nmyF92TXL8oJs0ZIppxW9gZ2c5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSbFFhkEV_nEWRwsFLHpiI2jUFJglq8XvHAQ0FREYe6sA&oe=6B084D94"}, "display_name": "BTI: VR Training", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Key Features:\n\nHands-On Learning: Enhance your hands-on experience with a realistic virtual lab setting, ideal for BTI\u2019s BioSTART and Laboratory Associates Program.\n\nSelf-Paced Learning: Progress through learning modules at your own pace with built-in evaluations, ensuring you develop competencies before advancing.\n\nHaptic Feedback: Feel like you're performing real tasks with tactile feedback from the controllers.\n\nInstructor Monitoring: Instructors can track your progress and practice frequency, ensuring a smooth transition from virtual to real-world competency.\n\nAccessibility: Break down traditional barriers to training, providing more opportunities for underrepresented demographics.\n\nAdult Learning Principles: The program aligns with the principles of adult learning for effective skill development.", "short_description": "BTI VR Training is a cutting-edge training tool for the biotechnical sector, ideal for those entering the biotech industry. It combines practical lab simulations with interactive theoretical lessons, providing a comprehensive learning experience. This application is a key resource for acquiring essential lab skills, serving as a bridge to the dynamic biotech world."}]}, "developer_name": "Capitol Interactive LLC", "develo